{"parse": {"title": "春日迟-04", "pageid": 134676, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-03\" title=\"春日迟-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">春日迟-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-05\" title=\"春日迟-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">春日迟</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BA.B8.E7.87.95.E4.B8.8E.E8.B6.8A.E9.B8.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"纸燕与越鸟\">纸燕与越鸟</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 纸燕与越鸟</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Old Tricks</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>去岁枯枝败叶叠了厚厚的一层，又被融化的雪水浸透。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿措牵着骡子，深一脚浅一脚地走在前面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-647112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-647112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-647112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>呼……呼……我还以为天气转暖后会好走些……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-314112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-314112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-314112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>就在这里歇歇吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪顺手牵过那头花里胡哨的骡子，将缰绳拴在路边的一棵枯树上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>你为何不骑着它走？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似是听到有人叫它，骡子抬头看了道人一眼，又低头继续寻找枯叶下的草籽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>因为，这骡子不是我的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我们要去的气脉凝滞之处，就在东门渡一位老丈的居所旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>气凝的事，我和他有些解释不明白……但他听闻我是来帮忙的，便非要以家中宝骡相赠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>无功不受禄，事我还没办妥，自然不能拿人家的好处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿措在骡子背上拍了拍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">骡子：</div><div>咴？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪颇为赞赏地点了点头，也拍了拍骡子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>你说得不错，正该如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-642601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-642601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-642601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">骡子：</div><div>咴！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>对了，鹭鸶剪，方才你说去过东门渡，那是什么时候的事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我想想啊……我记不清，但总归是很久很久之前了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>可你瞧着并不比我大多少啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>这可说不好，世上有许多能让容颜永驻的术法。譬如采月华，苏合香灰敷面，或者服食无根之水煎制的汤药……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>真的吗？鹭鸶剪，你用的是哪一种？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——哪一种都不是。你这么容易上当，家中长辈怎么放心让你独自在外游历？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>咳咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，我休息得差不多了。我们抓紧些，或许还能赶在天黑前回镇上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿措环顾四周，忽然有些犹疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>只是，我好像……又找不到路了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>穿过树林往东去……东边是哪边？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，你说东边是往左呢，还是往右？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:133%\">半个时辰后。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>唉，又回来了。鹭鸶剪，原来你也不认路啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>没办法，我从前一向跟着师兄师姐们，哪用得着自己找路？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>不过……既然是要去气凝之处，我倒还有个法子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——通幽洞微，默运虚无！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摊开手心吹一口气，轻柔的风带着燕子飘浮起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>下一秒，它对鹭鸶剪歪了歪头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我在它身上留了一道“气”，只要距离不太远，就能找到凝滞的气脉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>唔，但愿我们没走太多岔路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>燕子绕着鹭鸶剪飞了两圈，从容落在她的发髻上，又低头啄了啄翅膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>奇怪，这回飞得好快。阿措，你瞧见它去哪里了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>……它好像在你头上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我……我头上吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她愣了愣，伸手一把摘下头顶的剪纸燕子，与它对视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>燕子蹲在她的掌心，一动不动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻后，鹭鸶剪叹了口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>好吧好吧，个么我晓得的呀……不是你的错，但我们是要你寻别的东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她对燕子轻声嘟囔着阿措听不懂的话，又伸出食指飞快画了几道符箓，双掌轻轻一拍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>燕子四处张望一阵，终于不情不愿地拍拍翅膀，慢慢悠悠往右手边的树丛飞去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>这下对了……厉害吧？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>呼，呼……鹭鸶剪，你在客栈用的也是这招吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>差不多，小把戏而已。你要是想学，我可以教你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>方才一直在找路，我都忘了问，你和那人是怎么打起来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>他是个骗子，差点连我都骗了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>他在桥头支摊算卦，说淳镇地气不祥，所以才日渐萧条。只要乡民奉上香火，他就能作法请走煞气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>起初，我还以为他知道气脉凝滞的关窍，打算诚心请教……可仔细看了两日，才发现不过是个骗子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>他确实会术法，表演了些让枯叶在空中随着手势打转、让石子凭空浮起之类的把戏，乡民看了，立刻信了七八分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我和他对峙，还没说几句，他就拔了刀……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>原来如此。那你动手前有没有考虑过，要是打不过他怎么办？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>嗯……总不能由着他害人。打不打得赢，打了才知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>如果打不过呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>或许会有如你这样的人路见不平的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>要是也没有呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪伸手为阿措拦开她未注意到的枯枝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>多谢你。事若不济……我跑就是了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我年纪小，输了也不丢人。等以后本领高了，自然能打赢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>等我到了……对，等我到了你的年纪，大概就不会再输。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我的年纪吗？那还要过很久呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>不过，你这打不过就跑的想法，倒也可以算是从心所欲、道法自然了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿措没有接话，沉默地走了一段，忽然背对着身后的鹭鸶剪开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，那骗子虽是胡言乱语……但他说镇上兴旺不起来，好像又没说错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>送我骡子的老丈说，淳镇从前也是很繁华的……现在只有附近祝县大集的时候，这里才有几分人气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>气脉凝滞，真的会让一个地方……让那么多人，都变得不顺遂吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>唔，或许吧。草木凋敝，流水腐坏，鸟兽远徙……这些都是有可能的，具体如何，还是去看过才知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>毕竟能影响一处地方兴衰的东西可太多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>我下山这些日子，看到不对的事就去管，碰到不平就去争，打赢了几场架，揭穿了几次骗局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>开当铺的王大官人强压价钱、盘剥乡里，我与他理论过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>李天师用香灰冒充丹药坑害病人，我拆穿了他的把戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>走镖的赵把头纵容手下欺凌商户，我也和他动过手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>可……可好像什么也没变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>但我觉得，只是我现在懂得还不够多。如果我像你一样，或者比你更厉害……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——那也没办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>阿措，你想得很深嘛。但这世上确实许多事是谁也做不到的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>高明的术法或许能让枯死的老树重发新芽，让花朵鲜妍百年长开不败……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>但没人能回到已经过去的春天。世间万物有自己的流向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>道人忽地侧耳细听，笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>算啦，还是先从眼下的事开始吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>你有没有听到水声？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "春日迟-04"}}